# Tamiyo, Upriser Crowned: "When Tamiyo enters, you become the monarch" (Bot1 wears it), and "Whenever one or more creatures
# deal combat damage to you while you're the monarch, tap those creatures and put a stun counter on each of them." Two
# Llanowar Elves attack Bot1 together for 2: one trigger for the batch, so each gets one stun counter, not two. Tamiyo shows
# her flying, double strike and haste. Bot2's creatures took the crown as they damaged the monarch.

